WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Program · 01/04 Initial State
less stored negative FG charge; p-channel is not in its programmed conductive state.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.508
Program · 02/04 Apply Conditions
select pMOS and establish a lateral channel field; coupling shifts FG potential.

3
00:00:06.508 --> 00:00:10.517
Program · 03/04 Carrier Motion
accelerated holes create electron–hole pairs; some hot electrons enter FG through oxide.

4
00:00:10.517 --> 00:00:13.017
Program · 04/04 Retained Result
Q− remains after the pulse; the p-channel conducts more readily at specified read bias.
